# ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# MKO Universal AI Agents — gitignore
#
# Protecting this from accidental commit during the AMD Radeon Hackathon:
#   • `data/`        — runtime state (users, credits, refund codes), the
#                      webui settings (API keys live here too), and the
#                      auto-seeded admin password hash + session tokens.
#   • `.env*`        — environment variable materialization; secrets live
#                      here at runtime, the in-tree template is .env.example.
#   • `__pycache__/` — Python build artifacts.
#   • `.freebuff/*.log` — preview server logs captured by the Freebuff
#                      desktop app. The launcher (.freebuff/launch.py) and
#                      the run doc (.freebuff/run.md) ARE tracked.
# ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────

# Runtime state — never commit. App seeds defaults on first start.
data/

# Local environment overrides — only .env.example is committed.
.env
.env.local
.env.*.local

# Python
__pycache__/
*.py[cod]
*$py.class
*.egg-info/
.venv/
venv/
.pytest_cache/
.coverage
.pytest_cache/

# RAG vector index produced at runtime
*.qdrant/

# IDE / editor
.vscode/
.idea/
*.swp
*.swo

# OS / upload cruft
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db

# Freebuff preview internals — DO commit `.freebuff/run.md` and
# `.freebuff/launch.py` (operator helpers). DO NOT commit the logs.
.freebuff/*.log
.freebuff/*.pid
